@startuml Sequence_7
hide footbox
title Scenario 7: Enemy Turn — Goblin Still Stunned, StunEffect Expires

participant "BattleEngine" as Engine
participant "Goblin" as Goblin
participant "StunEffect" as Stun
participant "GameState" as State
participant "GameApp" as App

note over Engine, App
  Continuation of the same executePlayerTurn() call as Scenario 6.
  Goblin's StunEffect has remainingTurns=1 entering this turn.
  Now processing: Goblin (SPD 25) in the enemy phase.
end note

Engine -> Goblin : beginTurn()
note over Goblin : Iterates activeEffects\ncalls StunEffect.onTurnStart(goblin)
Goblin -> Stun : onTurnStart(goblin)
note over Stun : remainingTurns > 0\nremainingTurns-- (1→0)\nreturn true (skip turn)
Stun --> Goblin : true (skip turn)

Goblin -> Stun : isExpired()
note over Stun : remainingTurns = 0 → true
Stun --> Goblin : true

Goblin -> Stun : onExpire(goblin)
note over Goblin : StunEffect removed from activeEffects\ncanAct = false\nreturns false
Goblin --> Engine : false (cannot act)

note over Engine : beginTurn() returned false\nEnemy AI strategy NOT executed\nNo damage TurnFrame added

Engine -> Engine : sweepDeadEnemies()
note over Engine : Goblin alive — nothing removed

Engine -> State : checkEndCondition() → 0
Engine -> Engine : endRound()
note over Engine : endRound() decrements specialSkillCooldown (2→1)\nrebuilds turn order — Goblin has NO StunEffect now

Engine --> App : 0 (continue)
App -> Engine : drainTurnFrames()
App -> App : render TurnFrames\n(only Warrior's Potion frame)

@enduml
